{0 ohttp-cohttp-eio}

Oblivious HTTP over cohttp-eio: a client that fetches key configurations and
calls through a relay, a relay, a gateway with replay protection, and
forwarding to targets.

{!modules: Ohttp_cohttp_eio}

See the {{:https://github.com/thevilledev/ocaml-ohttp/blob/main/doc/http-libraries.md}HTTP libraries}
guide, and the {{:https://github.com/thevilledev/ocaml-ohttp/blob/main/SECURITY.md}security policy}
for what the adapters leave to the application.
